# Conforming fixture: a raw surface typed unanalyzed prose, structure matching its level (lang:SurfaceAnalysisShape).

@prefix lang: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/lang/> .

ex:english a lang:SignSystem .
ex:latin a lang:Script .
ex:s a lang:UnanalyzedProse ; lang:inSignSystem ex:english ; lang:surfaceText "hello world" ;
    lang:inScript ex:latin ; lang:unicodeNormalization "NFC" ; lang:collationLocale "en" ;
    lang:analysisLevel lang:rawLevel .
